<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Emperor reported profit increases.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Emperor reported profit increases.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fiji-based gold miner goldminer Emperor Mines Ltd said on Tuesday that its reported net profit for the year ended June 30, 1996 had increased to A$9.5 million from A$7.9 million as a result of accounting treatment changes.</p>
<p>The accounting change was a revised treatment of an unrealised exchange loss on internal loans.</p>
<p>The company had originally reported the full year net profit of A$7.9 million for the year to June 30 on July 26.</p>
<p>The company also said gold resources had increased to 1.6 million ounces from 1.3 million ounces.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
